  "description": "Production-grade, defense-in-depth file upload pipeline for ASP.NET Core 8+.\n\n      Provides an 8-layer validation and encrypted-storage pipeline:\n        Layer 1  File size limits (per-file and batch)\n        Layer 2  Extension allowlist (.jpg .jpeg .png .webp .pdf)\n        Layer 3  MIME type ↔ extension cross-validation\n        Layer 4  Magic-byte / file-signature verification\n        Layer 5  Filename inspection (double-extension, Unicode tricks, path traversal)\n        Layer 6  Deep content validation — JPEG/PNG/WebP structural walkers, PDF\n                 pattern scan including FlateDecode-compressed stream inspection\n        Layer 7  Virus scanning via Windows Defender or ClamAV (pluggable IVirusScanService)\n        Layer 8  AES-256-GCM envelope-encrypted storage outside wwwroot,\n                 image recompression to strip polyglot tails\n\n      Includes a reference hardened download controller and a SharpFuzz/AFL++ harness\n      for the deep content validator.",
